senses.gloss:
--the body of ब्रह्मा, while the ब्राह्मण is his heart. Both dependent on each other;
1: भा. III. २२. 3-4; Br. II. ३६. २३.
created with the ब्राह्मण, and hence no obstacle to intermarriage between क्षत्रिय and ब्राह्मण;
2: M. ३०. १९-20.
dharma of; no sin in killing men in war.
3: M. ४३. १८; १०३. २१-22; ११४. १२.
